---
const title = 'Delete my account · Zymplo';
const description = 'How to permanently delete your account and all your data on Zymplo.';
const lastUpdated = '2026-05-04';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#14B8A6" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://zymplo.com/en/legal/delete-account/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="es" href="https://zymplo.com/legal/delete-account/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="pt-BR" href="https://zymplo.com/pt/legal/delete-account/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://zymplo.com/en/legal/delete-account/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="x-default" href="https://zymplo.com/legal/delete-account/" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/brand/isotipo.svg" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Manrope', system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 64px; color: #0A0B14; line-height: 1.65; background: #FAFBFF; }
      header { padding-bottom: 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb; margin-bottom: 32px; }
      header img { height: 40px; }
      h1 { font-size: 32px; margin: 16px 0 8px; }
      h2 { font-size: 22px; margin: 32px 0 12px; color: #0F9488; }
      p, li { font-size: 16px; }
      a { color: #14B8A6; }
      .meta { color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
      .step { background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 12px 0; }
      .step-num { display: inline-block; background: #14B8A6; color: #fff; width: 28px; height: 28px; border-radius: 50%; text-align: center; line-height: 28px; font-weight: 700; margin-right: 8px; }
      .box-warning { background: #FEF3C7; border-left: 4px solid #F59E0B; padding: 16px 20px; border-radius: 6px; margin: 16px 0; }
      footer { margin-top: 64px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb; color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="https://zymplo.com/"><img src="/brand/isotipo.svg" alt="Zymplo" /></a>
      <h1>Delete my account</h1>
      <p class="meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      <p class="meta"><a href="/legal/delete-account/">Español</a> · <a href="/pt/legal/delete-account/">Português</a> · English</p>
    </header>

    <p>You can permanently delete your Zymplo account and all your data at any time. There are 3 equivalent ways:</p>

    <h2>Option 1 · Via WhatsApp (fastest · 30 seconds)</h2>
    <div class="step">
      <p><span class="step-num">1</span> Send the Zymplo bot the message: <strong>"delete my account"</strong> · <strong>"borrar mi cuenta"</strong> · or <strong>"deletar minha conta"</strong>.</p>
      <p><span class="step-num">2</span> The bot will ask for confirmation with a button.</p>
      <p><span class="step-num">3</span> You confirm · and the deletion is executed within 24 hours.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Option 2 · Via email</h2>
    <div class="step">
      <p>Send an email from your registered account to <a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a> with the subject <strong>"Account deletion request"</strong> and include your Zymplo WhatsApp number.</p>
      <p>We respond within 15 business days at most (LGPD · GDPR).</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Option 3 · Web form</h2>
    <div class="step">
      <p>Fill out the form at <a href="https://zymplo.com/legal/delete-request/">zymplo.com/legal/delete-request/</a> with your WhatsApp number · we respond through the same channel.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>What gets deleted</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Your user profile and preferences.</li>
      <li>Complete history of conversations with the bot.</li>
      <li>Client list · payment collections · expenses · appointments · notes.</li>
      <li>Usage statistics and personal analytics.</li>
      <li>Any active subscription (cancelled immediately · no prorated refunds except as required by local law).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What is kept temporarily</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Issued NFS-e:</strong> kept for 5 years in Brazil due to fiscal obligation (we cannot delete them). They remain associated with an anonymous identifier.</li>
      <li><strong>Anonymized technical logs:</strong> 90 days for security and fraud prevention.</li>
      <li><strong>Encrypted backups:</strong> 30 days after deletion · then destroyed.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="box-warning">
      <strong>⚠️ It is irreversible.</strong> Once the deletion is confirmed · we cannot recover your data. If you want to keep a copy · request an export by email before deleting.
    </div>

    <h2>Future re-registration</h2>
    <p>After deleting you can sign up again with the same number at any time · but you start from scratch · with no history.</p>

    <h2>Questions</h2>
    <p><a href="mailto:privacy@zymplo.com">privacy@zymplo.com</a></p>

    <footer>
      <p>Zymplo Inc. · Delaware USA · EIN 30-1486305 · Zymplo Brasil LTDA · CNPJ 66.667.634/0001-00 · Fortaleza CE</p>
      <p><a href="/">Back to zymplo.com</a> · <a href="/en/legal/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> · <a href="/en/legal/terms/">Terms</a></p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
